#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: dolphinmainwindow.cpp:1627
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis paste"
msgid ""
"This copies the items from your <emphasis>clipboard</emphasis> to the currently viewed folder.<nl/>"
"If the items were added to the clipboard by the <emphasis>Cut</emphasis> action they are removed from their old location."
msgstr ""
"Isto copia os elementos do <emphasis>portapapeis</emphasis> ao cartafol actual.<nl/>"
"Se os elementos se engadiron ao portapapeis mediante a acción <emphasis>Cortar</emphasis> retíranse do seu lugar anteriores."

